OL,4,BFifa to confirm UK as host for 2035    
OL,5,BWomen's World Cup                      
OL,6,GFifa is set to confirm on Monday that  
OL,7,Ga first football World Cup will be     
OL,8,Ghosted in the United Kingdom since     
OL,9,G1966.                                  
OL,11,FEngland, Northern Ireland, Scotland    
OL,12,Fand Wales are the only bidders to      
OL,13,Fjointly stage the 2035 Women's World   
OL,14,FCup.                                   
OL,16,FA delegation will be present at Fifa's 
OL,17,FZurich headquarters with national      
OL,18,Fassociations holding a specially       
OL,19,Farranged virtual meeting, and voting   
OL,20,Fto ratify the co-hosts.                
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
